  "limitations": [
    "Bundled native gateway targets Windows x64 only. macOS uses external OneBot with no implicit Docker fallback.",
    "NapCat LRL forbids commercial use and requires full license/source attribution for redistribution; QQ native and Node bundled dependencies retain their separate rights.",
    "Existing user data root and application ID remain unchanged. Old Docker volumes are not deleted, modified or automatically converted into Windows login credentials.",
    "No real QQ login or contact send/receive; QR generation and WebUI readiness only. No real Fish paid calls or WeChat phone playback.",
    "Windows OS IME and NSIS interactive installation/uninstallation not exercised. Packages unsigned/not notarized.",
    "One pre-existing 0.2-second timeout fixture failed on initial full Windows run; unchanged target passed three times and the identical full rerun passed. Logs retained.",
    "Startup measurements are single-machine samples, not LLM reply latency or performance guarantees. Portable cold self-extraction measured 46.76s; frozen QQ preparation observations include extraction, verification and status polling.",
    "Mac native-dropdown automation was inconclusive; external mode was verified by frozen HTTP API and frontend behavior tests."
  ],
